OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after report of firearm
OL,4,Adischarged in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter it received a report a firearm
OL,8,Fhad been discharged in a village in
OL,9,FLeicestershire.
OL,11,FOfficers called to a report shortly
OL,12,Fafter 22:00 BST on Wednesday that
OL,13,Fdamage had been caused to the window of
OL,14,Fa house and a car parked in Ravenstone
OL,15,FRoad in Heather.
OL,17,FThe force said officers attended and
OL,18,Fdetermined the damage was consistent
OL,19,Fwith a firearms discharge.
OL,21,FIt added no-one had been injured and no
OL,22,Farrests were made.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
